        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK are delighted to bring the fantastic property to the market. A superb opportunity to acquire a top-floor, extra-spacious two-bed, two-bath penthouse in the highly sought-after Dakota Court development. This impressive home offers exceptional privacy, generous proportions, and uninterrupted canal views, making it one of the standout apartments in the area.\r\n\r\nThe property opens into a warm and inviting entrance hallway with excellent storage and a separate utility room—a rare convenience in modern city living. The heart of the\r\nhome is the expansive living and dining room, a bright, airy space flooded with natural light thanks to its top-floor position and large glazing. From here, doors lead to a private balcony that is not overlooked and enjoys spectacular views over the Royal Canal, offering a peaceful outdoor retreat.\r\n\r\nOff the main living area sits a separate, fully fitted kitchen, thoughtfully designed. The apartment includes two generous double bedrooms, each with ample built-in storage, along with a well-appointed family bathroom. The primary bedroom also benefits from an en-suite, adding comfort and practicality.\r\n\r\nA further highlight is the inclusion of secure underground parking, a highly desirable feature in this central location.\r\n\r\nSituated in the vibrant and ever-popular Phibsborough , the property enjoys immediate access to an excellent range of amenities. The area is home to independent cafés,\r\nartisan bakeries, lively pubs, gyms, and convenient grocery options including Tesco, Lidl, and local shops. The Royal Canal towpath provides scenic walking, running, and cycling routes right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nTransport links are superb, with the Luas Green Line at Phibsborough, multiple Dublin Bus routes, and easy access to the city centre, which is just a short stroll away. Nearby attractions include the Blessington Street Basin, the Botanic Gardens, Dalymount Park, and a host of cultural and recreational amenities.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
